# Backoffice Pass 2 — Shared components first

## Principle

Build reusable ops primitives under `apps/backoffice/components/bo`, then compose pages.

Do **not** implement list pages with page-local Tailwind substitutes for shared patterns.

```text
@repo/ui → generic controls/tokens
apps/backoffice/components/bo → ops compositions
page modules → domain content only
```

## Phase 1 — `components/bo` (locked)

| Area | Exports |
| --- | --- |
| Shell | `BackofficeShell`, `Sidebar`, `WorkspaceSwitcher`, `SidebarSection`, `SidebarItem`, `AccountFooter` |
| Page | `PageHeader` (+`.Meta` `.Actions`), `PageToolbar`, `PageBody`, `PageFrame` |
| Filters | `FilterTabs`/`FilterTab`, `EntityTabs`/`EntityTab`, `FilterBar`, `SearchField`, `FilterSelect`, `MoreFiltersButton`, `ClearFiltersButton` |
| Table | `DataTable` (+ Header/Row/Cell/Checkbox/Identity/Actions/Footer) — thin recipe, not a giant DataTable lib |
| States | `StatusBadge`, `AttentionState`, `EmptyState`, `BulkActionBar`, `SkeletonRows` |
| Actions | `OverflowMenu`, `RowActionMenu`, `ConfirmDialog` |
| Inspector | `InspectorPanel`, `InspectorHeader`, `InspectorActions`, `InspectorSection`, `InspectorField`, `InspectorBody` |

Rules: violet = selected/active only; hover neutral; ops density; no landing spacing.

## Phase 2 — Products list (reference)

Compose Products from `bo` primitives only:

Header → FilterTabs (All/Active/Draft/Archived) → FilterBar → BulkActionBar → DataTable → InspectorPanel → pagination footer.

Domain-only: commerce labels, config fractions, product actions.

## Next (explicit)

Product detail → Projects/Library apply same primitives → dashboard → dense workspace.
